# Codex config — generic agent rules and skills. The skills dir is merged child-by-child so
# new skills are picked up without a manifest edit, and host-local / external-symlinked skills
# in ~/.codex/skills are left untouched. (The private sprout skill is merged in from the private
# repo; default.rules is NOT tracked — it accretes per-command trust state that leaks history.)
.codex/AGENTS.md
merge-children .codex/skills

